# Commands

Single entrypoint: `make verify` (= `make check`: `check_format` + `lint` + `type_check` + `test`).

- `make install` — `uv sync --dev`
- `make build` — install, lint, type-check, test
- `make verify` — all checks without installing (use before declaring done)
- `make test` — pytest with coverage floor
- `make lint` — `ruff check src/ tests/`
- `make type_check` — `ty check src/{{cookiecutter.pkg_name}}`
- `make check_format` / `make fix_format` — ruff format check / fix
- `uv build` — sdist + wheel
{% if cookiecutter.use_analytics == "y" -%}
- `make install-analytics` / `make jupyter` — analytics extra + Jupyter Lab
{% endif %}
